dvancing\n              healthcare accessibility and women&#39;s health globally.\n            ",[19903,20062],"\n              We're supported by leading organizations committed to advancing\n              healthcare accessibility and women&rsquo;s health globally.\n            ",[4748,5069],"\n                      Breast cancer is the most common cancer among women in\n                      Sub-Saharan Africa, yet for many, it&apos;s detected far too\n                      late. Rural clinics lack the tools. Trained specialists\n                      are few. And treatment often comes too late.\n                    ",[4748,5069],"\n                      Breast cancer is the most common cancer among women in\n                      Sub-Saharan Africa, yet for many, it&lsquo;s detected far too\n                      late. Rural clinics lack the tools. Trained specialists\n                      are few. And treatment often comes too late.\n                    ",[4748,5069],"\n                      Breast cancer is the most common cancer among women in\n                      Sub-Saharan Africa, yet for many, it&#39;s detected far too\n                      late. Rural clinics lack the tools. Trained specialists\n                      are few. And treatment often comes too late.\n                    ",[4748,5069],"\n                      Breast cancer is the most common cancer among women in\n                      Sub-Saharan Africa, yet for many, it&rsquo;s detected far too\n                      late. Rural clinics lack the tools. Trained specialists\n                      are few. And treatment often comes too late.\n                    ",[8756,9067],"\n              With the IntelliBra Pink Alert app, patients can easily register,\n              receive screening results, and manage follow-up care—all from\n              their phone. It&apos;s secure, bilingual (English & French), and\n              designed for ease of use, even with limited internet.\n           